{"3715770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oh! Robot: Legendary Mechanic", "steam_appid": 3715770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/828921bc677bf7071bf61c870baba0be.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thanks to rapid advances in AI technology, every product now comes with an AI-based OS, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">making human life more convenient than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">“Can you live without AI?” Under this slogan, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">companies rushed into fierce competition to develop AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, the overheated race led to a flood of incomplete AIs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">eventually causing social chaos as they turned against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">People began calling this phenomenon “AI Shock.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Around that time, Judy, the only daughter of Glory Electronics, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">grew furious at the daily inconvenience of not even being able to order a pizza properly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Determined to end the chaos, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">she boarded a robot and headed into the perilous streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1477dbaf55cac376b04c591e55d9a927.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1200 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/88de925ead03b8ea3c4ac56ae82bc4eb.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oh! Robot?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This project began as an homage to works from 1995 to 2010, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">aiming to reinterpret the unique emotions and styles of that era through a modern lens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Waepons &amp; Rampaging robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 40 types of weapons and 20 rampaging robots were inspired by various animations and films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Development Intent</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game was created to deliver the thrilling experience of directly controlling and using weapons that were once only seen in cinematic scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Never give up, Never surrender!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This phrase is the central catchphrase of Oh! Robot and a philosophical message for all of us living in today’s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It’s also a motto I send to myself as a solo game developer a message straight to my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.poster.avif?t=1787713562\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.webm?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.mp4?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/3dcf9cca738944e4870823e223beb0bc.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> [ Story Mode ]</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>3Level Difficulty System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game offers three difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, and Hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the difficulty increases, rampaging robots gain more health and attack power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On Hard mode, the game follows a roguelite style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">if you die during gameplay, the story resets and you must start over from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Drop &amp; Stat System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destroying rampaging robots may drop weapons at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each weapon comes with randomized stats hunt for the ultimate gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Upgrade System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons can be upgraded up to five levels, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">with each upgrade granting random stats. Forge the ultimate weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Selling System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sell unused weapons to earn currency, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">which can be used for weapon upgrades, HP recovery, and passive skill enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Passive Skill Enhancement System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade various passive skills to significantly boost your robot’s performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.poster.avif?t=1787713562\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.webm?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.mp4?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[ Survival Mode ]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade your weapons within a limited time and face off against a powerful final boss in this intense game mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mini-game modes will follow, offering fresh experiences and plenty of fun stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.poster.avif?t=1787713562\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.webm?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.mp4?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">0-Robot! Let's go! 🚀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/7271baa61ef2dddbc89b242c03666594.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/470a34857fb09707d51aa195af5acd10.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=1121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2bf9b6b319ce3ab678b135e59eef7448.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/828921bc677bf7071bf61c870baba0be.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thanks to rapid advances in AI technology, every product now comes with an AI-based OS, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">making human life more convenient than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">“Can you live without AI?” Under this slogan, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">companies rushed into fierce competition to develop AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, the overheated race led to a flood of incomplete AIs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">eventually causing social chaos as they turned against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">People began calling this phenomenon “AI Shock.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Around that time, Judy, the only daughter of Glory Electronics, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">grew furious at the daily inconvenience of not even being able to order a pizza properly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Determined to end the chaos, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">she boarded a robot and headed into the perilous streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1477dbaf55cac376b04c591e55d9a927.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1200 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/88de925ead03b8ea3c4ac56ae82bc4eb.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oh! Robot?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This project began as an homage to works from 1995 to 2010, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">aiming to reinterpret the unique emotions and styles of that era through a modern lens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Waepons &amp; Rampaging robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 40 types of weapons and 20 rampaging robots were inspired by various animations and films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Development Intent</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game was created to deliver the thrilling experience of directly controlling and using weapons that were once only seen in cinematic scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Never give up, Never surrender!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This phrase is the central catchphrase of Oh! Robot and a philosophical message for all of us living in today’s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It’s also a motto I send to myself as a solo game developer a message straight to my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.poster.avif?t=1787713562\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.webm?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.mp4?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/3dcf9cca738944e4870823e223beb0bc.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> [ Story Mode ]</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>3Level Difficulty System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game offers three difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, and Hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the difficulty increases, rampaging robots gain more health and attack power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On Hard mode, the game follows a roguelite style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">if you die during gameplay, the story resets and you must start over from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Drop &amp; Stat System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destroying rampaging robots may drop weapons at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each weapon comes with randomized stats hunt for the ultimate gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Upgrade System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons can be upgraded up to five levels, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">with each upgrade granting random stats. Forge the ultimate weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Selling System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sell unused weapons to earn currency, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">which can be used for weapon upgrades, HP recovery, and passive skill enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Passive Skill Enhancement System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade various passive skills to significantly boost your robot’s performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.poster.avif?t=1787713562\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.webm?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.mp4?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[ Survival Mode ]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade your weapons within a limited time and face off against a powerful final boss in this intense game mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mini-game modes will follow, offering fresh experiences and plenty of fun stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.poster.avif?t=1787713562\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.webm?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.mp4?t=1787713562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">0-Robot! Let's go! 🚀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/7271baa61ef2dddbc89b242c03666594.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/470a34857fb09707d51aa195af5acd10.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=1121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2bf9b6b319ce3ab678b135e59eef7448.avif?t=1787713562\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Oh! Robot is a top-down shooting game featuring the catchphrase 'NEVER GIVE UP! NEVER SURRENDER!' It follows the journey of a brave young girl who pilots a robot named ZeroBot to save the world from rampaging machines driven mad by a rogue AI. Engine start let’s go!", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/888bb99013f33d5fbc0c98948a95da0379c402e9/header.jpg?t=1787713562", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/287c0714ab035e32b351745d274fa4eebcb19558/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787713562", "capsule_imagev5": "